be like you know mew  and monkey and little boy sometimes  little girl would get in on the action  when carrie was around later he would do  it as well  and they'd all be like watching  belle who would be like you know a good  distance away  and one cat would start creeping forward  and maybe go like 10 feet and then just  stop and look at her and bell would be a  little bit nervous looking around what's  going on  another cat would creep up  and then another cat would creep up and  they'd get closer and closer and closer  to her you know until they were about  maybe five feet away and then she'd  freak out and start barking and you know  twisting around and then run away  these tiny cats  would effectively muscle a dog out of  her own territory but sometimes we would  also catch them like you know snoozing  together and they all they all liked  each other quite a bit  um so that's kind of a cool  story to end with and so this is my um  you know i think third  cat story at this point um there's more  to tell about other cats in my lifetime  but i just wanted to  introduce you to two of the cats that  were really important to me monkey and  mew  you
 

